小朋友食用，重點是桌上的一罐小花椒…還是辣椒😅，喜歡吃辣！愛吃辣的人！真的務必再吃到一半的時候加上一小湯匙！一碗拉麵兩種享受，而且一點也不燥熱，不會滿身大汗（體質因人而異😂）。價位也非常的親民，是值得再訪的優質拉麵店🍜",null,[0,91]]]],[null,1718171558000000,1718171558000000,"2 年前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfQm04RDJZUU1TTGxtYVRlbUFBcVg4dw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfQm04RDJZUU1TTGxtYVRlbUFBcVg4dxoTQ2d3SXB1LWtzd1lRck1qWHh3SQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjjxv3s6dGWAxX1iX0EHToVNacQ_2MI6gEoDQ"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/17148017930384297481/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUjZkVTExV21KbkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17148017930384297481/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUjZkVTExV21KbkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/17148017930384297481/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUjZkVTExV21KbkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17148017930384297481/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUjZkVTExV21KbkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17148017930384297481/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUjZkVTExV21KbkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17148017930384297481/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUjZkVTExV21KbkVBRRAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["能讓您滿意真的是太高興了，麵匡匡致力追求的不僅是讓您吃飽，讓您吃得開心滿意是我們最大的目標。您的肯定是我們進步的最大動力，感謝您的支持~",null,[0,68]]]],[null,null,4913,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR6dU11WmJnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xf77db233ba9c2fbc!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDzuMuZbg%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR6dU11WmJnEAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR6dU11WmJnEi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRHp1TXVaN2dFEhNDZ3dJc3VxTHN3WVEyUGV5N1FJGi0KFkNJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRHp1TXVaSGcSE0Nnd0lzdXFMc3dZUTJQZXk3UUkiEgkAAAAAAAAAABG8L5y6M7J99yoLMGFOa